  "limitations": [
    "This is a candidate ledger revision, not a measured platform release.",
    "Every 10.29.8 revision 7 function, check, ground and coverage claim is carried over unchanged; only release source references were made explicit (a 10.29.8 review reference now names the 10.29.8 snapshot).",
    "pim.matrix-fields: 10.30 adds MASTER to default-language inheritance and shared or language-specific values per matrix column. The cells check reads stored rows per declared language; a declaration that names a language which inherits or shares a column may read no stored cell there. On ledger-supherb-matrix (10.30.6, 2026-11-13) the matrix category Matrix_nutritionFacts still stores its cells per product and language (2748 rows, ENU) and no matrix column or key changed in the upgrade.",
    "orders.bc-invoices has a planned binding only and stays UNVERIFIED.",
    "commerce.price-groups SQL reads have fixture red controls (Corrections.Tests.ps1) and were executed on one 10.30.6 database without groups; a site with groups has not been measured."
